  "content": {
    "id": "v2-1ddc9-p55-practice-slot-8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Solve each of these equations for $0\\leq\\theta<360^\\circ$.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "v2-1ddc9-p55-practice-slot-8-slot-8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\cos^2\\theta=\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=45^\\circ,\\ 135^\\circ,\\ 225^\\circ,\\ 315^\\circ$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos^2\\theta&=\\frac12\\\\\\cos\\theta&=\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\\\A&=\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)=45^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\nThe positive value gives Q1 and Q4; the negative value gives Q2 and Q3.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=45^\\circ,\\ 180^\\circ-45^\\circ,\\ 180^\\circ+45^\\circ,\\ 360^\\circ-45^\\circ\\\\\\theta&=45^\\circ,\\ 135^\\circ,\\ 225^\\circ,\\ 315^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 50
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-1ddc9-p55-practice-slot-8-slot-8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$3\\tan^2\\theta=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=30^\\circ,\\ 150^\\circ,\\ 210^\\circ,\\ 330^\\circ$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3\\tan^2\\theta&=1\\\\\\tan^2\\theta&=\\frac13\\\\\\tan\\theta&=\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\A&=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)=30^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\nThe positive value gives Q1 and Q3; the negative value gives Q2 and Q4.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta&=30^\\circ,\\ 180^\\circ-30^\\circ,\\ 180^\\circ+30^\\circ,\\ 360^\\circ-30^\\circ\\\\\\theta&=30^\\circ,\\ 150^\\circ,\\ 210^\\circ,\\ 330^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 55
      }
    ]
  },
